    "rating": "not applicable",
    "explanation": "No ForgeX solutions are applicable. ForgeX offers fixed-price automations for owner-led residential home-service contractors (HVAC, plumbing, electrical) managing lead-to-dispatch pipelines. Creations Unlimited is a precision industrial machine shop."
  },
