  "qualification": {
    "category": "not a fit",
    "rationale": "Creations Unlimited is a precision 5-axis CNC machining job shop catering to the aerospace, medical device, semiconductor, and hi-tech industries. ForgeX exclusively targets owner-led home-service contractors (HVAC, plumbing, and electrical) that pay for residential leads. The company operates entirely outside ForgeX's target vertical and relies on specialized industrial CAD/CAM and manufacturing ERP systems."
  }
